<http://data.silknow.org/object/98e79992-7e7e-33b5-9856-f4c41de8dc53/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Woman's petticoat made of dark green silk satin, lined with coarse glazed green wool and wadded with a thin layer of wool.  It is quilted in running stitch with dark green silk thread in a border of abstract flowers and leaves around the hem, with parallel ogee arches above.  The petticoat is made of 7 panels of silk, with an opening at the centre back seam and pocket openings cut into the side panels and bound with 1-inch wide (2.5 cm) dark green silk ribbon.  The hem is bound with the same ribbon. \n\nThe petticoat was altered in the late 19th century, either for fancy dress or a studio prop.  The waist binding and ties were removed and replaced with 19th century braid, hooks and eyes."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/98e79992-7e7e-33b5-9856-f4c41de8dc53> .

<http://data.silknow.org/object/98e79992-7e7e-33b5-9856-f4c41de8dc53>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Woman's petticoat made of dark green silk satin, lined with coarse glazed green wool and wadded with a thin layer of wool.  It is quilted in running stitch with dark green silk thread in a border of abstract flowers and leaves around the hem, with parallel ogee arches above.  The petticoat is made of 7 panels of silk, with an opening at the centre back seam and pocket openings cut into the side panels and bound with 1-inch wide (2.5 cm) dark green silk ribbon.  The hem is bound with the same ribbon. \n\nThe petticoat was altered in the late 19th century, either for fancy dress or a studio prop.  The waist binding and ties were removed and replaced with 19th century braid, hooks and eyes."@en , "Woman's petticoat, 1750-70,  British; dark green silk satin, quilted with a floral border; altered 1870-1910"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/2aaf58a6-2ab3-34da-be98-9f8f2beeb25b> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/b64eac49-876e-3887-9995-4d248c5f72c7> ;
